      "support_status": "SUFFICIENT",
      "rationale": "The span explicitly supplies this prohibition; the frozen atom accurately isolates it."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C022_SIGNAL",
    "value": "An alignment repeatedly matches distinctive patterns across overlapping records, respects independent dates and holds against histories withheld from selection. Cross-stage comparisons require established relationships and preservation of genuine processing delays; matches requiring unexplained changes in those delays indicate unresolved chronology.",
    "scope": "Prospective alignment evidence, assumed observed for this judgment, including the restrictions on comparing different workflow stages.",
